{"id":"be2f7055d3d9e268","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-axiom.md","title":"Axiom","display":"df-axiom — Axiom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-axiom","aliases":["88-df-axiom"],"display":"df-axiom — Axiom","depends_on":["[[88-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-axiom — Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (candidate nonlogical axiom set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AxiomSet}_S(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{AxiomSet}_S(A)\\)</span> (axiom-set predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AxiomSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AxiomSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AxiomSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AxiomSet}_S\\)</span> : 作为某个理论呈现的非逻辑公理集合</li>\n<li>公理构成理论的出发点</li>\n</ul>\n<p>公理类型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>逻辑公理：纯逻辑系统的公理</li>\n<li>非逻辑公理：特定理论的公理（如算术公理）</li>\n<li>公理模式：生成无限公理的模式</li>\n</ul>\n<p>例子（命题逻辑公理）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\rightarrow (B \\rightarrow A)\">\\(A \\rightarrow (B \\rightarrow A)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A \\rightarrow (B \\rightarrow C)) \\rightarrow ((A \\rightarrow B) \\rightarrow (A \\rightarrow C))\">\\((A \\rightarrow (B \\rightarrow C)) \\rightarrow ((A \\rightarrow B) \\rightarrow (A \\rightarrow C))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A \\rightarrow \\neg B) \\rightarrow (B \\rightarrow A)\">\\((\\neg A \\rightarrow \\neg B) \\rightarrow (B \\rightarrow A)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>例子（Peano算术公理）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(x) = S(y) \\rightarrow x = y\">\\(S(x) = S(y) \\rightarrow x = y\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg S(x) = 0\">\\(\\neg S(x) = 0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x + 0 = x\">\\(x + 0 = x\\)</span></li>\n<li>数学归纳公理模式</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本定义只给出句法类型。可枚举性、一致性与独立性都是某个具体公理呈现\n可能具有的附加性质，并非“公理集”一词自动保证的结论。</p>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>：公理定义理论</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86a742fad2207b40\" href=\"?note=86a742fad2207b40\" title=\"88-df-derivation\">88-df-derivation</a>：从公理出发的推导</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>：公理和规则构成系统</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"targe